<body>
    <h1>21.01.2026</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p>Attendees: Niels B. (chair), Nico P, Didi K., Thomas L., Daniel =
B., Markus N., Ivan M., Richard W., Victoria N., Pierre M., Yan H., Martin =
H., Roland W., Justus K., Ben S., Mike J.K., Gareth Q., Johan N., Stian K.,=
 Jason MacC. Ryan Mc K.,</p>
<p>Agenda:&nbsp;</p>
<ol>
 <li data-uuid=3D"e73b0ac9-5e40-4441-a6c2-a38fae3fc74c">Status OGraf specif=
ications - Remarks on GitHub</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"2188e998-e8a3-405c-82a4-9a01c8110737">Status API specific=
