 <li data-uuid=3D"7548d1c9-b770-4d55-b3ce-d4b9045db648">Should we have a 20=
26&nbsp;get-together AKA full day workshop?</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a2d7f788-619c-43f0-a14f-995a397096a6">Q&amp;A</li>
</ol>
<p><br></p>
<p>Meeting notes</p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"7f50647d-a079-4255-8102-b08db3a5c547">The group went thro=
ugh the =E2=80=9Cissues=E2=80=9D posted on github, please check<a href=3D"h=
ttps://github.com/ebu/ograf" class=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow"> here=
</a></li>
 <ul>
  <li data-uuid=3D"c67aaaa6-41b2-4427-814e-990d36e71f27">GDD moving over is=
 completed, superfly will provide instruction to test it locally before mer=
ging it</li>
  <li data-uuid=3D"c699f6ad-f32b-497b-96b4-60da5d0a2e2e">MOS support will b=
e added but some work is still needed</li>
  <li data-uuid=3D"44ddc17d-c605-4880-9578-832b08c54031">Control API ready =
to be tested, looking for volunteers; developer guidelines need to be provi=
ded</li>
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"60b502e5-e3c4-49f8-a74f-16454da30c32">Is the current ve=
rsion ready to be published as version 1? To be agreed</li>
  </ul>
 </ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"e2ae0bcf-1c79-4605-81ef-654dac3487f9">Templates are welco=
me for the PTS demo (27-29<sup>th</sup> Jan, Geneva)</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"d525e37a-8514-42a0-9f04-6213258c2ad7">Very likely to have=
 a physical meeting in Feb or later in the year</li>
</ul>
